# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback. Without this, a deep link like
# /locations/emerson-point 404s on a hard refresh — the router only exists
# once index.html has booted. 200 (not 301) so the URL the reader typed
# survives into the address bar and into the router.
#
# Kept below any real file: Pages matches static assets first, so this never
# shadows /assets/* or /admin.html.
/*    /index.html   200
